message: "If you reference this prototype, please cite it as below."
title: "Project ThermoLogic: Logical Energy as Test-Time Compute"
authors:
  - family-names: "Teo"
    given-names: "Qing Cong Eugene"
type: software
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/joperjoker/Project-ThermoLogic"
abstract: >
  A reproducible PyTorch proof-of-concept fusing Differentiable Theorem Proving
  (fuzzy-logic t-norms) with an Energy-Based Model: logically valid outputs sit
  at zero energy, contradictions cost exponentially more, and gradient descent
  on the energy scores and repairs neural outputs against hard rules at a
  controllable test-time compute budget.
keywords:
  - neuro-symbolic AI
  - energy-based models
  - differentiable logic
  - test-time compute
